@baseUrl = http://localhost:6688/console

### Get All Clients
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients

### Get Single Client
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients/1

### Create Client
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Client",
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "phone": "123-456-7890"
}

### Update Client
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Client",
  "email": "updatedclient@example.com",
  "phone": "098-765-4321"
}

### Delete Client
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clients/1